<p class="has-text-align-center has-graphite-color has-text-color" style="margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--24)">Defense manufacturers operate in an environment where requirements can change quickly, but manufacturing performance must remain dependable. Programs may involve highly complex assemblies produced in relatively small quantities, with extensive documentation and traceability requirements. At the same time, evolving defense priorities are creating demand for production models that can support faster deployment, modular designs, and higher manufacturing volumes.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
